#! ia 1.0

@schema design-token
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have token
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    may have meaning.answers as text
    must have token.name as text "Canonical token identifier."
    must have token.tier as id in [primitive, semantic, component]
    must have token.category as id in [color, typography, spacing, size, radius, border, shadow, motion, z-index]
    may have token.css-var as text "CSS custom property name (for example '--surface-primary')."
    may have token.classes as list of text "Semantic or component utility classes bound to this token."
    may have token.value as text "Default resolved value or reference expression."
    may have token.modes as list of text "Optional mode overrides '<mode>=<value>'."
    must have token.standing as id in [proposed, active, deprecated, retired]
  edges
    may supersede design-token one
